ns on Eritrea as Houthi attacks disrupt Red Sea shipping and fighting escalates in Ethiopia's Tigray region. Analysts say Eritrea's strategic value is growing.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Ethiopia: Internet disrupted in Tigray amid conflict escalation</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:ae3626d7f88192f3abb79ab8cfd3561ea982f0b73cf71ecd078363f11c08c0d1</id><updated>2026-09-28T16:50:17Z</updated><published>2026-09-25T07:44:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/ethiopia-internet-disrupted-in-tigray-amid-conflict-escalation/a-79424191--15879d4d7c53.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/ethiopia-internet-disrupted-in-tigray-amid-conflict-escalation/a-79424191?maca=en-rss-en-africa-8291-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">A web monitor reported an internet disruption in northern Ethiopia amid renewed fighting between the Tigray People's Liberation Front (TPLF) and the federal government.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>How renewed fighting in Tigray could spread across the Horn of Africa</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:c339f08b114fe11be73f2e884c88ab38728ac66d47497cff794a4ceb77622430</id><updated>2026-09-28T16:50:17Z</updated><published>2026-09-25T05:58:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/how-renewed-fighting-in-tigray-could-spread-across-the-horn-of-africa/a-79410333--a598375bf2c9.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/how-renewed-fighting-in-tigray-could-spread-across-the-horn-of-africa/a-79410333?maca=en-rss-en-africa-8291-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The fresh hostilities in Ethiopia's Tigray region come after months of growing animosity between rebel forces and the federal government. Horn of Africa expert Martin Plaut warns of possible regional spillover.</summary><category term="World" /></entry></feed>
